1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,140
What if the creature
everyone fears is

2
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:04,044
also the source of
their harvest?

3
00:00:04,064 --> 00:00:04,914
Meet the Grimmaw.

4
00:00:04,934 --> 00:00:06,377
It eats a sheep a
moon.

5
00:00:06,397 --> 00:00:08,353
The lazy version:
it's a monster,

6
00:00:08,373 --> 00:00:09,533
so drive it off.

7
00:00:09,553 --> 00:00:10,542
Press run.

8
00:00:10,562 --> 00:00:11,202
Ten years.

9
00:00:11,222 --> 00:00:12,515
No more lost sheep.

10
00:00:12,535 --> 00:00:14,310
Then the flocks eat
the fields.

11
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:15,185
No monster.

12
00:00:15,205 --> 00:00:16,379
No harvest.

13
00:00:16,399 --> 00:00:18,086
Fear and need share
one scale.

14
00:00:18,106 --> 00:00:19,411
Four rules level it.

15
00:00:19,431 --> 00:00:20,925
The fifth is the
twist.

16
00:00:20,945 --> 00:00:22,119
One:
offerings.

17
00:00:22,139 --> 00:00:23,831
A sheep each moon,
so it never raids

18
00:00:23,851 --> 00:00:24,646
the pens.

19
00:00:24,666 --> 00:00:25,933
Two:
holy ground.

20
00:00:25,953 --> 00:00:27,484
Nobody farms its
meadow.

21
00:00:27,504 --> 00:00:28,415
Three:
harvest.

22
00:00:28,435 --> 00:00:30,240
It keeps grazers off
the crops.

23
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:31,619
It gets the first
sheaf.

24
00:00:31,639 --> 00:00:32,802
Four:
medicine.

25
00:00:32,822 --> 00:00:34,364
Keepers gather its
shed plates for

26
00:00:34,384 --> 00:00:35,291
fevers.

27
00:00:35,311 --> 00:00:36,105
Run it again.

28
00:00:36,125 --> 00:00:36,705
Ten years.

29
00:00:36,725 --> 00:00:37,405
Still feared.

30
00:00:37,425 --> 00:00:38,409
Still fed.

31
00:00:38,429 --> 00:00:39,134
Rule five?

32
00:00:39,154 --> 00:00:40,034
The keepers.

33
00:00:40,054 --> 00:00:41,334
Whoever speaks for
it speaks for

34
00:00:41,354 --> 00:00:42,253
everyone.

35
00:00:42,273 --> 00:00:43,565
So it's always
hungry.

36
00:00:43,585 --> 00:00:45,622
Unless everyone
watches it eat.

37
00:00:45,642 --> 00:00:46,690
An open rite.

38
00:00:46,710 --> 00:00:48,216
Nobody fakes its
hunger.

39
00:00:48,236 --> 00:00:49,891
Worship isn't
superstition.

40
00:00:49,911 --> 00:00:51,454
It's a deal with
danger.

41
00:00:51,474 --> 00:00:52,972
What creature would
your civilization

42
00:00:52,992 --> 00:00:54,793
worship despite its
danger?

43
00:00:54,813 --> 00:00:56,205
Part 30 of 50.

44
00:00:56,225 --> 00:00:58,268
Follow for part 31:
hero,

45
00:00:58,288 --> 00:00:59,593
or monster?
